<title>USA: Roosevelt shareholders agree to merger.</title>
<headline>Roosevelt shareholders agree to merger.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt Financial Group Inc Friday said its shareholders approved the merger of Roosevelt with a wholly-owned subsidiary of St. Louis-based Mercantile Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>In late December, Roosevelt and Mercantile agreed to merge in a transaction offering Roosevelt holders $0.22 in cash or 0.4211 shares of Mercantile common stock.</p>
<p>Ninety-eight percent of stockholders voting approved the merger, Roosevelt said.</p>
<p>Roosevelt shares closed down 1/8 at 24-1/8 Friday and Mercantile shares were unchanged at 60-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
